ASET-CAUSAL-NET 1 ASET-NETWORK-DYNAMIC-ALPHA4-CAUSAL
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE
MODE PREDICATE

TRANSITION PROFILE-APPLICABLE ASET-NETWORK-DYNAMIC-APPLICABILITY
REQUIRE EXACT_PROFILE_BINDING
REQUIRE TARGET_LOCAL_ALLOW
OUTPUT VALUE TRUE
END

TRANSITION PROFILE-NETWORK-STUTTER ASET-NETWORK-DYNAMIC-NETWORK-STUTTER
REQUIRE SAME_NETWORK
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT VALUE TRUE
END
